{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56298","headline":"题孟岩 · 毛熙圣","name":"题孟岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"资中多秀异，自古出贤良。\n川岳炳灵气，烟霞舒瑞光。\n家家习诗礼，处处闻丝簧。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一五七《资州》。\n）（按：此诗原题「唐毛熙圣」作，疑即蜀词人毛熙震之昆从。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙圣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}